            <div class="section-text change-order">
              <h2>Mobile Web Development</h2>
              <h4>Mobile devices generate over 50% of global website traffic. (Statista)</h4>
              <p>Want to make your website look as beautiful on mobile as it does on desktop? Meet Alpha Efficiency.</p>
              <p>With so many people using handheld devices for browsing, it has become extremely important for businesses to have websites that provide a uniform experience on both mobile and desktop. At our <a href="https://alphaefficiency.com/web-design-agency-chicago">web design agency in Chicago</a>, we are experts in utilizing both responsive and adaptive web design to ensure that your website content is formatted perfectly regardless of the platform your visitors use so you wouldn’t miss out on any business opportunity that may arise.</p>
              <p>Not making your website mobile responsive can harm your search engine optimization efforts and prevent you from ranking high on Google. If you want to stay ahead of the curve and protect your online success, contact our web development company, and we will gladly assist you.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="section-img">
              <img src="/assets/images/services/web-dev-img/webdevmobile.svg" alt="website development for mobile">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div> 
</section>

